  "notes": "The panel does not keep a month. A month panel cannot know which months exist, so the host owns the month, the host owns the buttons that change it, and the host owns the words in the footer. What the panel gives the host is a grid it can drop into any frame, drawn the way the calendar draws it: today is a filled circle with a number on it, so it is a surface with text and takes the brand's on-colour; selected is a ring with nothing on it, so it is a shape and takes the graphic form of the brand colour; disabled is a number that takes the derived disabled colour, and it is marked with aria-disabled rather than with a class of its own. A selected day that stands inside a range stands on the brand's tint and not on the panel's surface, so there it takes the foreground the contract writes for that tint, and its ring takes the brand colour as text — the pair the contract writes for a mark on a soft surface.",
  "notesZh": "面板自己不记着是哪个月。月份面板不知道有哪些月份可选,所以月份归宿主管,翻页的按钮归宿主管,页脚上的字也归宿主管。面板给宿主的只是一张能放进任何框里的日期网格,画法跟日历一样:今天是填满的圆,圆上有数字,所以它是一块带字的表面,用的是品牌色的 on 色;选中是一个圈,圈里没有字,所以它是一个形状,用的是品牌色的 graphic 形态;禁用是一个数字,用的是派生出来的禁用色,而且是用 aria-disabled 标出来的,不是用一个类。落在区间里的那个选中日,脚下是品牌色的那层淡色而不是面板的底色,所以它用契约为那层淡色写下的前景色,那圈环则用品牌色当文字 —— 这正是契约为一层淡色上的标记写下的那一对。"
}
